[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "かき氷、美味し～！　疲れた身体に染みるー",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "姉様が望むなら、何杯分でも氷を砕いてみせるわ。\n一世一代の大仕事に筋肉も喜んでいる",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "んじゃ、お言葉に甘えておかわりしようかな～。\nヤドヴィガはどう？　美味しい？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "大変美味。\n氷に味を付けただけなのに、なぜこんなにも……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "アルビちゃん特製「錬金術シロップ」よ！\nんふふ、頬当てがないと表情がよく分かっていいね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "表情……そんなに変わってるかな",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "アタシ、人の表情の変化を見るのには自信があるんだ。\nいつもベップのこと、よく見てるしね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "いつも見てるなんて、姉様……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "よし、じゃあ作戦会議するよ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "この旅行の目的は、ヤンネさんとヤドヴィガに\n行楽地での休暇を楽しんでもらうこと！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "だけどヤンネさんは真面目な人だから、\n休暇に来ても鍛錬や仕事で動き回ってる",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "そうなんだよね。だから鍛錬よりも\n魅力的な休暇を提案しようって思うんだけど――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "休暇……休んでほしいなら、\nヤンネと戦い、倒してでも休ませればいい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "九偉人、物騒……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ヤンネさんは神聖国最強の聖戦士だよ？\nそれはまず無理だって……それに――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "休暇は楽しんで、いい思い出にしてほしいからさ。\nされて嬉しいことだけで企画したいんだ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "されて嬉しいこと……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "……難しい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "うん。何をされて嬉しいかは人それぞれだもん。\n相手のことをよーく考えないとね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "localized_name": "三人",
    "romanized_name": "",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "うーん……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 0,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "localized_name": "？？？",
    "romanized_name": "???",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "おお、そこにいるのは！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 0,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "ん、この声はもしかしなくても……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "お前たちも行楽に来ているのか！\nはっはっは！　なんとも奇遇だな！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "localized_name": "千歳",
    "romanized_name": "Chitose",
    "model_path_hash": 3924733721061764343,
    "text": "皆様、こんにちは……\nふふ、これも、神のお導きでしょうか",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4561510886967726962,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "鏑矢さんに、千歳！\nわ、すっごい水着似合ってる！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "そうであろうそうであろう？\n千歳の水着姿、実に愛いであろう？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "して、三人で何か悩んでいるようだったが……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "余に話してみよ！\n内容次第では、力になろう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "localized_name": "堂免鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya Doumen",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "ケイウン南部を統治する堂免家の若き当主。\nゼレンタ島に休暇を楽しみに来た",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "localized_name": "波照間千歳",
    "romanized_name": "Chitose Hateruma",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "物静かで儚い印象の、堂免家付きの巫女。\nゼレンタ島に休暇を楽しみに来た",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4561510886967726962,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]